{"seq":2,"slug":"sql-database-fundamentals","title":"SQL 与数据库基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-programming-basics/sql-database-fundamentals","wordCount":877,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"sql-与数据库基础\">SQL 与数据库基础</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>SQL 是数据工程师与分析师的通用语言——无论底层是 MySQL、PostgreSQL，还是 Hive、Spark SQL、ClickHouse，SQL 语法都是访问数据的第一接口。扎实的 SQL 能力和关系数据库理论直接决定了数据处理的效率和数据模型的质量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"mysql-实操基础\">MySQL 实操基础</h3><p>MySQL 是高职大数据教学和中小企业最常用的关系数据库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 建表与约束&#10;CREATE TABLE user_orders (&#10;    order_id    BIGINT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,&#10;    user_id     INT NOT NULL,&#10;    product_id  INT NOT NULL,&#10;    amount      DECIMAL(10, 2) NOT NULL,&#10;    status      ENUM(&#39;pending&#39;, &#39;paid&#39;, &#39;shipped&#39;, &#39;completed&#39;, &#39;cancelled&#39;),&#10;    created_at  DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,&#10;    INDEX idx_user_created (user_id, created_at)&#10;) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4;&#10;&#10;-- 批量插入与性能对比&#10;INSERT INTO user_orders (user_id, product_id, amount, status)&#10;VALUES (1001, 50, 299.00, &#39;paid&#39;),&#10;       (1002, 32, 159.00, &#39;pending&#39;),&#10;       (1001, 78, 499.00, &#39;completed&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 建表与约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> user_orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTO_INCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    product_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    amount      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ENUM(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shipped'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cancelled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_user_created (user_id, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CHARSET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">utf8mb4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 批量插入与性能对比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_orders (user_id, product_id, amount, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">299</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1002</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">159</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">78</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">499</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>索引设计的核心原则：<strong>高选择性列优先</strong>，复合索引遵循<strong>最左前缀匹配</strong>。一个合理的索引可以将查询时间从秒级降到毫秒级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关系设计与范式理论\">关系设计与范式理论</h3><p>关系模型设计需要在规范化与查询性能之间取得平衡：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第一范式（1NF）</strong>：每列原子值，不可再分</li>\n<li><strong>第二范式（2NF）</strong>：消除部分依赖（非主属性完全依赖于主键）</li>\n<li><strong>第三范式（3NF）</strong>：消除传递依赖</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"erDiagram\" data-source=\"erDiagram&#10;    &quot;用户&quot; ||--o{ &quot;订单&quot; : &quot;下单&quot;&#10;    &quot;订单&quot; ||--|{ &quot;订单明细&quot; : &quot;包含&quot;&#10;    &quot;商品&quot; ||--o{ &quot;订单明细&quot; : &quot;被购买&quot;&#10;    &quot;用户&quot; {&#10;        int user_id PK&#10;        string name&#10;        string email&#10;    }&#10;    &quot;订单&quot; {&#10;        bigint order_id PK&#10;        int user_id FK&#10;        datetime created_at&#10;        string status&#10;    }\">erDiagram\n    \"用户\" ||--o{ \"订单\" : \"下单\"\n    \"订单\" ||--|{ \"订单明细\" : \"包含\"\n    \"商品\" ||--o{ \"订单明细\" : \"被购买\"\n    \"用户\" {\n        int user_id PK\n        string name\n        string email\n    }\n    \"订单\" {\n        bigint order_id PK\n        int user_id FK\n        datetime created_at\n        string status\n    }</pre><p>实践中，OLTP 系统倾向 3NF（减少冗余、保证一致性），而数据仓库倾向反范式（宽表、预计算，减少 JOIN 提升查询速度）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复杂查询技巧\">复杂查询技巧</h3><p>大数据分析中常用的高级 SQL 模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 窗口函数：用户最近 3 笔订单的累计金额&#10;SELECT user_id, order_id, amount,&#10;       SUM(amount) OVER (&#10;           PARTITION BY user_id&#10;           ORDER BY created_at&#10;           ROWS BETWEEN 2 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW&#10;       ) AS rolling_3_sum&#10;FROM user_orders&#10;WHERE status = &#39;completed&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- CTE + 递归：组织架构层级展开&#10;WITH RECURSIVE org_tree AS (&#10;    SELECT id, name, parent_id, 1 AS depth&#10;    FROM departments WHERE parent_id IS NULL&#10;    UNION ALL&#10;    SELECT d.id, d.name, d.parent_id, ot.depth + 1&#10;    FROM departments d&#10;    JOIN org_tree ot ON d.parent_id = ot.id&#10;)&#10;SELECT * FROM org_tree ORDER BY depth, name;&#10;&#10;-- 行列转换（PIVOT）&#10;SELECT user_id,&#10;       SUM(CASE WHEN MONTH(created_at) = 1 THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS jan,&#10;       SUM(CASE WHEN MONTH(created_at) = 2 THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS feb,&#10;       SUM(CASE WHEN MONTH(created_at) = 3 THEN amount ELSE 0 END) AS mar&#10;FROM user_orders&#10;WHERE YEAR(created_at) = 2026&#10;GROUP BY user_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 窗口函数：用户最近 3 笔订单的累计金额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id, order_id, amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rolling_3_sum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- CTE + 递归：组织架构层级展开</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RECURSIVE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> org_tree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, parent_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> departments </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> departments d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> org_tree ot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> org_tree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 行列转换（PIVOT）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MONTH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(created_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jan,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MONTH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(created_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MONTH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(created_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> YEAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(created_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2026</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"存储过程与事务\">存储过程与事务</h3><p>存储过程封装复杂业务逻辑，减少网络往返，适用于批量数据处理场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"DELIMITER //&#10;CREATE PROCEDURE settle_daily_orders(IN settle_date DATE)&#10;BEGIN&#10;    DECLARE EXIT HANDLER FOR SQLEXCEPTION ROLLBACK;&#10;&#10;    START TRANSACTION;&#10;&#10;    UPDATE user_orders&#10;    SET status = &#39;completed&#39;&#10;    WHERE status = &#39;shipped&#39;&#10;      AND created_at &lt; settle_date - INTERVAL 7 DAY;&#10;&#10;    INSERT INTO daily_settlement (settle_date, total_amount, order_count)&#10;    SELECT settle_date, SUM(amount), COUNT(*)&#10;    FROM user_orders&#10;    WHERE status = &#39;completed&#39;&#10;      AND DATE(created_at) = settle_date;&#10;&#10;    COMMIT;&#10;END //&#10;DELIMITER ;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DELIMITER </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PROCEDURE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settle_daily_orders(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settle_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    DECLARE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EXIT HANDLER </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SQLEXCEPTION </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROLLBACK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    START TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'shipped'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settle_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_settlement (settle_date, total_amount, order_count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settle_date, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(created_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settle_date;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> //</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DELIMITER ;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>事务的 ACID 特性保证了数据一致性：原子性（Atomicity）、一致性（Consistency）、隔离性（Isolation）、持久性（Durability）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据建模方法论\">数据建模方法论</h3><p>面向分析的数据建模通常采用维度建模（Kimball 方法）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>事实表</strong>：记录业务事件的度量值（金额、数量、时长）</li>\n<li><strong>维度表</strong>：描述事件的上下文（时间、地区、产品、用户）</li>\n<li><strong>星型模型</strong>：事实表在中心，维度表围绕辐射</li>\n<li><strong>雪花模型</strong>：维度表进一步规范化拆分</li>\n</ul>\n<p>维度建模的核心思想是&quot;以业务过程为中心&quot;，每个事实表对应一个可度量的业务事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>HTAP 数据库</strong>：TiDB、PolarDB 等支持事务与分析混合负载，减少 ETL 延迟</li>\n<li><strong>SQL on Everything</strong>：DuckDB（嵌入式 OLAP）让开发者在笔记本上直接对 Parquet/CSV 运行分析 SQL，无需搭建集群</li>\n<li><strong>AI 生成 SQL</strong>：Text-to-SQL 模型（如 BIRD-SQL 基准测试达到 85%+ 准确率）正在重塑数据分析工作流</li>\n<li><strong>向量搜索扩展</strong>：pgvector、MySQL HeatWave 将向量相似度搜索内嵌到传统关系数据库</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>设计一个电商数据库的星型模型，包含订单事实表和 4 个维度表，写出建表 DDL</li>\n<li>使用窗口函数计算每个用户的订单间隔天数（相邻两笔订单的 <code>created_at</code> 差值），找出流失风险用户（间隔 &gt; 30 天）</li>\n<li>编写一个存储过程，自动清理 90 天前的临时数据，并记录清理日志</li>\n<li>思考：为什么数据仓库倾向使用反范式设计？在什么情况下第三范式仍然是更好的选择？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>SQL 是大数据生态中贯穿始终的技能——从 MySQL 的 OLTP 场景到 Hive/Spark SQL 的 OLAP 分析，语法一脉相承。掌握关系设计理论确保数据模型的合理性，熟练运用窗口函数和 CTE 解决复杂分析问题，理解事务机制保障数据一致性。这些能力在后续学习 Hive 数据仓库和 Spark SQL 时将直接迁移复用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SQL 与数据库基础","id":"sql-与数据库基础"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"MySQL 实操基础","id":"mysql-实操基础"},{"level":3,"text":"关系设计与范式理论","id":"关系设计与范式理论"},{"level":3,"text":"复杂查询技巧","id":"复杂查询技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"存储过程与事务","id":"存储过程与事务"},{"level":3,"text":"数据建模方法论","id":"数据建模方法论"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Python 数据编程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-programming-basics/python-data-programming"},"next":{"title":"Linux 与 Shell 脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-programming-basics/linux-shell-scripting"}}